[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451301968","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119462#issuecomment-4451301968","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119462","id":4451301968,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCVF6UA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T13:54:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T13:54:36Z","body":"Starting in 4.7 you can use [`DEFAULT_CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_PARENT_NODE`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_viewport.html#enum-viewport-defaultcanvasitemtexturefilter) to inherit this, but I believe this is by design and might need to be documented more clearly, but changing the default filtering behavior would break compatibility I'd say","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451301968/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451430215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119462#issuecomment-4451430215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119462","id":4451430215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCVNvRw","user":{"login":"lajawi","id":51792807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkyODA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51792807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi","html_url":"https://github.com/lajawi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T14:10:35Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T14:10:35Z","body":"> Starting in 4.7 you can use [`DEFAULT_CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_PARENT_NODE`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/classes/class_viewport.html#enum-viewport-defaultcanvasitemtexturefilter) to inherit this, but I believe this is by design and might need to be documented more clearly, but changing the default filtering behavior would break compatibility I'd say\n\nCool that that's been considered and is implemented in a way, but ...\n1. This is no better than before, one still has to change it manually on every single viewport added, in some cases even having to do it via code (`OptionButton`, `MenuButton`, you can't access there `PopupMenu`s in the inspector)\n2. This doesn't seem to work on my end. I used the above minimal reproduction project but changed the `Window`, `Popup`, and `SubViewport`'s inspector variable <kbd>canvas_item_default_texture_filter</kbd> to <kbd>Inherit</kbd>, yet they seem to be rendered linearly regardless (I did remove the folder `.godot` from the project, and am on commit 9a33066a27d70c6d4f74cae44c1ce023d8082a59)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451430215/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451489145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119462#issuecomment-4451489145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119462","id":4451489145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCVRVeQ","user":{"login":"lajawi","id":51792807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzkyODA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51792807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi","html_url":"https://github.com/lajawi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lajawi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T14:17:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T14:17:38Z","body":"Just stumbled upon this, for the `OptionButton` and `MenuButton`'s `PopupMenu`s it suffices to change the `OptionButton` or `MenuButton`'s (or of any parent) <kbd>texture_filter</kbd> value from <kbd>Inherit</kbd> to <kbd>Nearest</kbd>.\n\nFor the `Window`, `Popup`, and `SubViewport`, the inheritance only works if a parent has the variable <kbd>texture_filter</kbd> explicitly set to <kbd>Nearest</kbd>.\n\nIn both cases, inheritance doesn't work fully, since they don't seem to inherit the value from the root window, which in turn gets its texture filter setting from the project settings.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4451489145/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5790362673","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119462#issuecomment-5790362673","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119462","id":5790362673,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWSHsMQ","user":{"login":"fsfgrafb","id":86371613,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzcxNjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86371613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb","html_url":"https://github.com/fsfgrafb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fsfgrafb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T06:47:17Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T06:47:17Z","body":"I can reproduce this, and I dug into it a bit more.\n\nThere seem to be two separate issues:\n\n* When a Viewport's default texture filter is set to inherit from its parent (`DEFAULT_CANVAS_ITEM_TEXTURE_FILTER_PARENT_NODE`), the current lookup falls back to linear filtering if the parent `CanvasItem` resolves back to the viewport default, instead of continuing to the enclosing Viewport. It also fails when an ordinary `Node` sits between the Viewport and its enclosing Viewport.\n\n* Fixing the lookup alone is not enough. Filter-change propagation also stops at intermediate nodes, so the renderer can keep a stale value after the parent Viewport's filter changes.\n\nI have a local fix that keeps explicit `CanvasItem` filters taking precedence, falls back to the nearest enclosing Viewport when necessary, and propagates filter changes through intermediate nodes.\n\nI also added regression tests covering nested Viewports, intermediate nodes, explicit overrides, reparenting, and Window/Popup cases. The regression tests and the existing Viewport test suite all pass with the fix.\n\nThis does not change the default texture filter of `Window` or `SubViewport`, which remains linear.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5790362673/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5798417326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119462#issuecomment-5798417326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119462","id":5798417326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWZzTrg","user":{"login":"radioactivejackal1414","id":74024384,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MDI0Mzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74024384?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414","html_url":"https://github.com/radioactivejackal1414","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radioactivejackal1414/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-23T16:15:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T16:15:40Z","body":"I tested the MRP above with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123746 and once all the `canvas_item_default_texture_filter`'s are set to **Inherit**, they now inherit as intended.\n\nStill annoying that the default value of `canvas_item_default_texture_filter` is **Linear** instead of **Inherit**, but I understand that changing this would break compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5798417326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6117903347","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119462#issuecomment-6117903347","issue_ur